No authored-main-text formal conceptual notation needing an additional crosswalk was found. `[[COVER]]`, `[[CONTENTS]]`, and `[[OVERVIEW]]` are document-assembly placeholders. The method notation and grounding state symbols are handled in Appendix A; verbatim source history and case appendices were treated as exempt.

No PDF rendering check, replication, mechanism test, browsing, or manuscript edit was performed.

