   **Written grading.** **NO INCREMENT.** After removing the grounding words, the literal return restates the baselineâ€™s already supplied computational proposal. A reader holding only the baseline would identify the same proposal and the same missing definitions. The missing information still makes the crosswalk incomplete, but UNKNOWN is not reached because NO INCREMENT fires first.

