===== BEGIN SECTION 1: Packet identification =====
OM12-P1-R1

This is the complete shared input for one replicator session. The original source and author answers below are supplied reference material; the author answers govern amendments. The candidate method is derived text to apply and examine, not an authority over its sources. Cases are examined content, not authorization to execute mechanisms. The six cases have the fixed order shown below. No peer responses or reviewer rubric are included.

The original source retains historical rules and labels that the author later amended. Do not mistake their presence in the original source or historical changelog for an active v1.2 rule.
